  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia Technical Assistance to Reform Corporate Financial Reporting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to contribute to an enhanced investment climate in Serbia by improving the institutional and technical capacity of supervisory authorities, professional organizations, and universities for quality financial reporting in line with the EU acquis communautaire and good international practice. To that effect, the project will focus on strengthening capacity for the accountancy and audit professions and improved monitoring and evaluation by regulators of financial reporting, for both private companies and SOEs.</narrative>
  </description>
